  "content": "\n\n<h1>Switch - Mod 與資源包群組管理</h1>\n<h4><span><span>Switch</span></span><span><span>&nbsp;是一款專為 Fabric 打造的<strong>強大</strong>且輕量級的模組管理工具。它允許您將<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">模組</span>與<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">資源包</span>組織成自訂的&nbsp;</span></span><span><span>群組</span></span><span><span>，並可透過單一可自訂的快捷鍵一鍵開啟或關閉。</span></span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong><span><span>主要功能：</span></span></strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span><span><strong><span><span>建立群組</span></span></strong><span><span><strong>:</strong> <em>隨意建立任意數量的群組（模組群組、資源包群組，或 M-R 混合群組）。</em></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span><span><span><strong><span><span>一鍵切換</span></span></strong><span><span><strong>:</strong> <em>為每個群組綁定快捷鍵，於遊戲內即可立即啟用或停用該群組。</em></span></span><em><span>&nbsp;</span></em></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span><span><span><span><strong><span><span>清晰精簡的介面</span></span></strong><span><span><strong>:</strong> <em>原生風格的 Minecraft 介面，畫質銳利清晰，100% 相容於模糊特效模組。</em></span></span><em><span>&nbsp;</span></em></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><span><span><span><span><span><strong><span><span>智慧過濾</span></span></strong><span><span><strong>:</strong> <em>自動隱藏基礎庫模組與內部資源包，保持列表整潔。</em></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>運作原理：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>資源包</span></span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong><em><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>按下快捷鍵後立即套用，無需開啟任何選單！</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></em></li>\n<li><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong><span><span>模組</span></span></strong><span><span><strong>:</strong> <em>由於 Fabric 載入器的技術限制，模組變更會在背景靜默準備，並於下次啟動 Minecraft 時生效。簡潔的通知訊息將在遊戲內提醒<em><span>您</span><span>&nbsp;。</span></em></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>為何選擇 Switch？</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></h3>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>非常適合需要切換不同遊玩風格的玩家：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic\"><em><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>快速切換效能模組或光影，適用於高幀率迷你遊戲。</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></em></li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic\"><em><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>即時啟用或停用視覺資源包。</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></em></li>\n<li style=\"font-style:italic\"><em><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>無需手動移動資料夾中的檔案，即可輕鬆管理不同的模組配置。</span></span><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
